  "description": "Bela Love is a romantic script font designed with elegant flowing lines and beautiful connected heart details.\nThis font is perfect for wedding invitations, branding, Cricut projects, logos, and Valentine designs. Its soft and feminine style adds a warm, heartfelt touch to any creative project.\nFeaturing smooth curves, stylish swashes, and unique heart ligatures, Bela Love brings a natural handwritten feel while maintaining a clean and professional look.\n✨ Features:\n– Elegant handwritten script style\n– Beautiful heart ligatures & connections\n– Beginning & ending swashes\n– Smooth and flowing letterforms\n– Perfect for romantic and feminine designs\n💡 Perfect for:\n– Wedding invitations\n– Branding & logos\n– Cricut & Silhouette projects\n– Social media graphics\n– Packaging & labels\n– Valentine & love-themed designs\n📦 What’s Included:\n– OTF & TTF font files\n💻 Compatible with:\n– All operating systems (Windows & Mac)\n– Canva\n– Cricut Design Space\n– Silhouette Studio\n– Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, InDesign\n– CorelDRAW & Affinity Designer\n– Microsoft Word & more",
